{"id":"a02f4a894755984c","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Stationary Reflection Point","display":"df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point — ZFC Comb8 Stationary Reflection Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point — ZFC Comb8 Stationary Reflection Point","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-stationary-reflection-point — ZFC Comb8 Stationary Reflection Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,S,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,S,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8StationaryReflectionPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8StationaryReflectionPoint}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8StationaryReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8StationaryReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both stationarity claims now use the canonical predicate. In particular, the ambient set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is required to be stationary, which the former formula omitted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ma